    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen up, comrade! Tired of feeling like a terrible chess player? Ditch the flashy modern tools. My routine is simple: I teach you a sharp concept, you apply it in a\u00a0puzzle, then I unveil the secret twist. Survive my training, and even lazy humans\u00a0can become masters of Soviet caliber.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your glorious Soviet tutor has arrived!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/f18940e610fae905be6245ae3d52fdd6.poster.webp?t=1755184132\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/f18940e610fae905be6245ae3d52fdd6.webp?t=1755184132\" class=\"bb_img\" width=540 height=304 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/a13918d01f4488aead1a40c573a779cc.poster.webp?t=1755184132\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/a13918d01f4488aead1a40c573a779cc.webp?t=1755184132\" class=\"bb_img\" width=540 height=270 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet BOT.VINNIK \u2014 the grumpy chess coach you never had. A titanium-brained</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > relic from another era, he\u2019s armed with elite knowledge, dry sarcasm, and zero </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >patience. He\u2019ll mock your every mistake\u2026 and still make you a better player.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick Up New Chess Concepts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/410354596e1eb7d5c7b4130e7a4101f1.poster.webp?t=1755184132\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/410354596e1eb7d5c7b4130e7a4101f1.webp?t=1755184132\" class=\"bb_img\" width=540 height=304 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOT.VINNIK introduces bite-sized chess lessons in a clear and engaging way, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >making it easy to understand essential concepts quickly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solidify Your Understanding Through Short Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/a130382b2940490f2d2c25b0b703b7a8.poster.avif?t=1755184132\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/a130382b2940490f2d2c25b0b703b7a8.webm?t=1755184132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/a130382b2940490f2d2c25b0b703b7a8.mp4?t=1755184132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply your freshly learned chess knowledge in quick and focused puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >designed to reinforce your skills immediately.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Lessons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/4c548bd48a272149a28db6c70bed2f5e.poster.avif?t=1755184132\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/4c548bd48a272149a28db6c70bed2f5e.webm?t=1755184132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/4c548bd48a272149a28db6c70bed2f5e.mp4?t=1755184132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through the academy's comprehensive curriculum, unlocking new </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >modules, puzzles, and advanced lessons as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Help from Laika</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/ad50217cc1171274143f831421a1820f.poster.avif?t=1755184132\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/ad50217cc1171274143f831421a1820f.webm?t=1755184132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/ad50217cc1171274143f831421a1820f.mp4?t=1755184132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever you're stuck, Laika, your robo-dog companion, is ready to guide you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > gently toward the best move</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break Your Records</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/311f844d7d676e3e35e876c9b3724be6.poster.avif?t=1755184132\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/311f844d7d676e3e35e876c9b3724be6.webm?t=1755184132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/311f844d7d676e3e35e876c9b3724be6.mp4?t=1755184132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your improvement with our intuitive scoring and leaderboard system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenge yourself to achieve higher scores and climb the ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your loyal robo-dog assistant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/f4cf26e04db65be49e07a69b9c605824.poster.avif?t=1755184132\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/f4cf26e04db65be49e07a69b9c605824.webm?t=1755184132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/f4cf26e04db65be49e07a69b9c605824.mp4?t=1755184132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Laika \u2014 your friendly, no-judgment guide through the academy. She\u2019s here </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to help even if you\u2019ve never moved a piece before. No sarcasm, just support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Artistic Style:</strong> Inspired by retro-futurism, Atomic Age aesthetics, and Soviet realism, BOT.VINNIK offers a distinctive visual experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Chess Puzzles:</strong> Solve thousands of \u201cfind the best move\u201d challenges to test and expand your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuously Expanding Content:</strong> Frequent DLCs bring fresh content covering essential chess topics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Scoring and Leaderboards:</strong> Track your performance, set personal records, and see how you rank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful Hints from Laika:</strong> Accessible assistance ensures players of all skill levels can enjoy and progress without frustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beginner Mode:</strong> A dedicated mode for players who\u2019ve never played chess, teaching basic moves and fundamental concepts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels:</strong> Customize your experience with easy, medium, and hard puzzles according to your skill and ambition.</p></li></ul>",
